<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets CITIC Pacific warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets CITIC Pacific warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Tuesday it intends to issue 168 million American-style warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PRICE    HK$43.78	PREMIUM	   22 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.478	GEARING	   8.3X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  04.DEC.97     EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     LISTING DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$39.80</p>
<p>NOTE: PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
